  "job_B9.5.6_20251003_115036": {
    "chunk_text": "a ut gangendan Cwyst \u00feu, nu \u00feu sprecest to me, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ne mage mine sawle geseon in me, & wenest \u00feu for\u00feon & Witodlice ic \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t se gecynd \u00fe\u00e6re sawle is ungesewenlic, & heo g\u00e6\u00f0 ut of \u00feam lichaman Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: ic m\u00e6g ge\u00feencan ea\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6re sawle lif wuniendre in \u00feam lichaman & ongytan of For\u00feon gif seo sawl n\u00e6re \u00e6t \u00feam lichaman, ne mihton na beon onstyrede \u00fea leomu \u00fe\u00e6s Gregorius \u00fea gyt spr\u00e6c: witodlice ne s\u00e6cge ic na \u00fea wisan gelice ac ungelice; for\u00feon swa swa Sume he gecwica\u00f0 mid oro\u00f0, sumum he syle\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t hi lufia\u00f0, sumum eac \u00fe\u00e6t an eallum gemete he \u00de\u00e6t \u00feu la, Petrus, ne tweost na \u00feone ungesewenlican God, \u00fe\u00e6t he is scyppende & rihtende & For\u00feon gedafena\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00fee Gode \u00feegnia\u00f0 & hyra\u00f0, higian symble to \u00fe\u00e6s gelicnesse & wyllan, Hw\u00e6t wena\u00f0 we o\u00fe\u00fee gelyfa\u00fe, hw\u00e6t \u00feas syn buton halige \u00e6nglas & rihtwisra manna gastas? For\u00feon nu swa swa \u00feu gesihst & hogast on \u00feinum mode, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s lichaman styrung & lif, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: rihte hit is eall as\u00e6gd, ac swa \u00feeah min mod flyh\u00fe nu gyt, \u00fe\u00e6t hit ne m\u00e6g gelyfan, Gregorius him andswarode: \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee Paulus la cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se geleafa w\u00e6re gehyhtendlicra \u00feinga",
